    <section class="page-header" style="padding: 140px 0 60px;"><div class="bg-gradient-animated"></div><div class="container"><p style="color:#93c5fd; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600;">BLOG</p><h1 style="font-size:2.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff; margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;">How to Get Verified Video Reviews</h1><p style="font-size:1.15rem; color:#cbd5e1; max-width:700px;">A step-by-step guide for Indian brands — from choosing a platform to receiving Power BI dashboards.</p><div class="header-accent"></div></div></section>
    <section style="background:#fff; padding:60px 0;"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px; line-height:1.8; color:#475569; font-size:1.05rem;">
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Text reviews are easy to fake. Video reviews show the real product in real conditions. Here is how Indian brands can get verified video reviews that they can actually use for analytics and advertising.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Step 1: Choose a Verified Video Review Platform</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Look for platforms that verify reviewers before they record. AnalyzeG uses 5-point verification: face-presence, device integrity, geo-consistency, content checklist, and timestamp validation — plus human moderation.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Step 2: Define Your Demographics</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Choose who reviews your product: state (region), age group, and gender. This ensures the feedback comes from your actual target audience — not random respondents.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Step 3: Receive Verified Videos</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Reviewers record 30-second in-hand videos of your product. Each video passes five screening checks and human moderation before entering the eligible pool. Available in-stock datasets may be delivered in minutes, with a 24-hour target; custom quotas are confirmed in writing before collection.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Step 4: Analyze with Power BI</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Receive a Power BI dashboard with sentiment scores, keyword themes, demographic breakdowns, and competitor benchmarks. Plus raw CSV/Excel with video links for your own analytics.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Step 5: Use as Ad Creative</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:2rem;">Own-product videos include ad licensing. Upload verified UGC directly to Meta Ads, Google Ads, TikTok, or use on your product pages.</p>
